# Staging directory used by the OLD deploy flow, which copied the PDF engine in from a checkout
# outside this repo. Nothing writes here now — the engine is tracked at engine/pdf-analyser
# (ADR 0029), the same way the Office analysers are owned under engine/office-analysers
# (ADR 0012). Kept ignored so a stale local copy from a previous deploy is never committed.
deploy/public/vendor/

# Partner code (DigitalA11y) full upstream solution — its own repo, not tracked here.
# The live-path analyser projects are OWNED and vendored under engine/office-analysers/
# (ADR 0012); only this full working clone stays ignored.
digital-accessibility/

# Isolated git worktrees created by Claude Code sessions — each is a full checkout,
# not source files.
.claude/worktrees/

# Session worktrees. CLAUDE.md makes `git worktree` under this path the standard way to isolate
# concurrent work here, so every session that follows the rule leaves a full second checkout in
# this directory — plus whatever node_modules it installed to run the frontend suite.
#
# Scoped to worktrees/ rather than to .claude/, which also holds tracked config (launch.json).
#
# Untracked, it is not merely noise: the stop hook asks for untracked files to be committed and
# pushed, and this is what it points at. Following that prompt literally would commit a copy of
# the repo into the repo.
.claude/worktrees/
